# Next.js in Framekit

- Default Server Components. Add `"use client"` only for upload, player, progress (hooks / browser APIs).
- Public API lives in `app/api/v1/**/route.ts` (Route Handlers) so `curl` and API keys work. Do not hide the platform API behind Server Actions.
- Secrets stay server-side. Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_` for database, S3, or Auth.js secrets.
- Dashboard pages may use Prisma on the server. Client components call Route Handlers; they do not import Prisma.
- Explain why a file is a client component when you add `"use client"`.
